KaiT2en-NixOS divergence: Touch Bar stateful-resume fast path.

On resume, wait for the vhci bus to settle instead of poking the
shared bus immediately: a stateful fast path that avoids wedging the
Touch Bar (black panel) after the second suspend/resume cycle.

Applied by apps/react-drm/package.nix on top of the upstream source
(-p1 relative to apps/react-drm).

Drop condition: remove when upstream react-drm's suspend service
gains an equivalent settle/wait on resume (watch
linux-touchbar-control-center/lib/services/suspend.ts upstream).
Re-check every sync.

